@startuml class_kpi
title Classes — Workload and KPI Engine (EVM)

top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBorderColor #2C5F8A
skinparam classHeaderBackgroundColor #D6E4F0
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam noteBorderColor #999999
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
hide circle
hide empty methods

class Project {
  - code : String
  - soldWorkloadDays : BigDecimal
}

class User {
  - email : String
}

class Resource {
  - dailyRate : BigDecimal
  - tccRate : BigDecimal
}

class AnnualTcc {
  - year : int
  - dailyRate : BigDecimal
  - tccRate : BigDecimal
}

class WorkloadPlan {
  - period : LocalDate
  - plannedDays : BigDecimal
}

class ActualWorkload {
  - period : LocalDate
  - actualDays : BigDecimal
  - submittedAt : LocalDateTime
  - validatedAt : LocalDateTime
}

class KpiSnapshot {
  - snapshotDate : LocalDate
  - evPct : BigDecimal
  - deliveryPct : BigDecimal
  - driftDays : BigDecimal
  - productionRevenue : BigDecimal
  - unbilledRevenue : BigDecimal
  - eac : BigDecimal
  - margin : BigDecimal
  - highlights : String
}

Resource "0..1" --> "1" User : cost of >
Resource "1" *-- "*" AnnualTcc : rate per year >
Project "1" *-- "*" WorkloadPlan
WorkloadPlan "*" --> "1" User : for >
Project "1" *-- "*" ActualWorkload
ActualWorkload "*" --> "1" User : for >
Project "1" *-- "*" KpiSnapshot : monthly reviews >

note right of AnnualTcc
  The daily cost uses the TCC rate for the year of the reported period.
end note

note right of KpiSnapshot
  The snapshot freezes the state of the monthly review (EV % entered by the PM).
end note

@enduml
